  "job_B21.2.1.1.2_20251003_114536": {
    "chunk_text": "onice, nefte, gi\u00f0corn, wyl on wine. Wi\u00fe wyrmum \u00fee innan egla\u00f0, wyrtdrenc of ontran, of feldmoran, sele drincan. Sealf, ete cele\u00feonian, brunewyrt awylle on morode, do \u00feonne scip tearo & swefl to, smire mid. Wi\u00fe \u00feam smalan wyrme, wi\u00feewindan twig foreweard & \u00fea fealwan doccan, n\u00e6s \u00fea readan, & \u00feis Wi\u00fe hond wyrmum & deaw wyrmum genim doccan o\u00f0\u00f0e clatan \u00fea \u00fee swimman wolde, \u00fea Gif wyrm hand ete genim mersc mear geallan & reade netlan & reade doccan & sm\u00e6le clifan, wyl \u00deonne sio sealf gesoden sie fur\u00feum nim \u00feonne sealtes \u00fery men, scead on, hrer tosomne & smire Wi\u00fe deawwyrme st\u00e6ppe on hat col, cele mid w\u00e6tre, st\u00e6ppe on swa hat swa he hatost m\u00e6ge. Wi\u00f0 deawwyrme sume nima\u00f0 wearm cwead monnes \u00feynne, binda\u00f0 neahterne on, sume swines Wi\u00fe hond wyrme nim sciptearo & swefl & pipor & hwit sealt, meng tosomne, smire mid. Weax sealf wi\u00fe wyrme, weax sealf, butere, pipor, hwit sealt, meng tosomne, smire mid. Wi\u00fe wyrmum \u00fee mannes fl\u00e6sc eta\u00f0, ram geallan \u00feone fagan cnua on niwe ealo \u00e6r \u00feon hit asiwen Eft, genim grunde swelgean \u00fee on eor\u00fean weaxe\u00fe & sceapes smeru, meng tosomne gelice fela, lege Eft, genim beren ear, beseng, lege on swa hat & hat w\u00e6ter,",
